<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reservation Completed - {{appName}}</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #2c3e50;
            background-color: #f5f7fa;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .email-wrapper {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .container {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 30px 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #11998e 0%, #38ef7d 100%);
            color: white;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .completed-title {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }
        .section {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e8ecef;
        }
        .section:last-of-type {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            padding-bottom: 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
        }
        .info-row:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
            padding-bottom: 0;
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 14px;
            flex: 0 0 40%;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-align: right;
            flex: 1;
            word-break: break-word;
        }
        .completed-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4edda 0%, #c3e6cb 100%);
            border-left: 4px solid #28a745;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .completed-box-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #155724;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .completed-box-text {
            color: #155724;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .thank-you {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .thank-you-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .thank-you-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #495057;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #11998e;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="logo">{{appName}}</div>
                <h1 class="completed-title">Reservation Completed</h1>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    Hello <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,
                </p>
                
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #495057; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    Thank you for using our facilities! Your reservation period has ended.
                </p>

                <div class="completed-box">
                    <div class="completed-box-title">✓ Reservation Summary</div>
                    <div class="completed-box-text">
                        <strong>Court:</strong> {{courtName}}<br>
                        <strong>Date:</strong> {{reservationDate}}<br>
                        <strong>Time:</strong> {{startTime}} - {{endTime}}<br>
                        <strong>Reference:</strong> {{referenceNumber}}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="thank-you">
                <div class="thank-you-title">Thank You!</div>
                <div class="thank-you-text">
                    We hope you enjoyed your time at {{appName}}.<br>
                    We look forward to seeing you again soon!
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                <p>If you have any questions or feedback, please contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
                <p>Visit us at <a href="{{appUrl}}">{{appUrl}}</a></p>
                <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #999;">
                    This is an automated notification. Please keep this for your records.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

